Hayaan mo akong tawagan si Sin-jin kahit isang beses lang!

00:18:57.698 --> 00:18:59.575
Sumpa man!

00:19:02.995 --> 00:19:04.914
NUMERO UNO

00:19:08.626 --> 00:19:09.627
Oo.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.045
Kailangan kitang maghanap ng paraan.

00:19:11.545 --> 00:19:13.839
Mula sa Yunit 1204 ng Palasyo ng Gancheon
