May mga update ba tungkol sa account number ni Attorney Han?

00:19:27.937 --> 00:19:29.814
Ginoong Kang!

00:19:30.773 --> 00:19:32.441
Pasensya na talaga.

00:19:33.067 --> 00:19:37.238
Pakiusap lang, huwag mo akong patayin!

00:19:38.364 --> 00:19:39.657
Nakuha ko na.

00:19:40.908 --> 00:19:42.159
Panahon na para tapusin ito.

00:19:44.203 --> 00:19:45.204
Opo, ​​ginoo.

